flowchart TD
  Start([User action]) --> Action{CRUD operation}
  Action -->|Create| Create[POST /books]
  Action -->|Read list| List[GET /books]
  Action -->|Read one| Read[GET /books/:id]
  Action -->|Update| Update[PUT /books/:id]
  Action -->|Delete| Delete[DELETE /books/:id]
  Create --> Validate[Validate payload]
  Update --> Validate
  Read --> IdCheck[Validate ObjectId]
  Delete --> IdCheck
  Validate --> Valid{Valid?}
  Valid -->|No| Bad[400 response]
  Valid -->|Yes| Persist[(MongoDB operation)]
  IdCheck --> Exists{Record exists?}
  Exists -->|No| Missing[404 response]
  Exists -->|Yes| Persist
  Persist --> Result[JSON response]
  List --> Result
  Bad --> Finish([Return response])
  Missing --> Finish
  Result --> Finish
